 "remarks": "Welcome to this adorable Colonial in Norwalk's desirable Spring Hill area, offering approximately 1,100 square feet and a flexible layout designed for today's lifestyle. The main level offers a nice kitchen, dining room, living room, and half bath, while the second floor features two bedrooms and a full bath. The lower level includes a studio apartment with a kitchenette, full bath, and separate walk-out entrance, making it an ideal option for extended family, guests, or a teen suite.  Enjoy outdoor living on the brand-new deck, completed just four months ago and ready for grilling, entertaining, or simply relaxing. The nicely sized lot provides great space for gardening and may even offer room for a future pool. Recent updates add peace of mind, including a water purifier, hot water heater, and central air system that are only about one year old, plus an electrical system updated to 200 amps. The roof is approximately 15 years old, with no reported claims.  Stop by to take a look-this one won't last long.",
